New-Cat "tanzania-safari-from-zanzibar" "Safari from Zanzibar: 1-7 day fly-in packages" "Fly from Zanzibar to Mikumi, Nyerere, Serengeti and Ngorongoro - island logistics explained, honest flight times." "BEACH" "Zanzibar is an island, so every safari below starts with a scheduled flight to the mainland - 30 minutes to Mikumi and Nyerere, 80 minutes to the northern circuit. One-day trips reach Mikumi and Nyerere only; two to three days add boat safaris and walking; four-plus days unlock the full Serengeti and crater. We handle all flight connections and meet you dockside on return." @(
 @("/tanzania-safari-from-zanzibar/1-day-safari-from-zanzibar/","1-Day Safari from Zanzibar","1 day | Mikumi/Nyerere",(GPrice "Tanzania" 1 1.0 350),"Dawn flight, full game drive, evening return."),
