New-Cat "tanzania-migration-safari" "Tanzania Migration Safaris: calving, Grumeti & Mara crossings" "Season-placed Migration safaris - Ndutu calving, western Grumeti, northern Mara River - plus month-by-month timing." "MIG" "Tanzania holds the herds ten months a year across three zones: Ndutu and the southern plains for January-to-March calving, the western corridor for June Grumeti crossings, and Kogatende for July-to-October Mara crossings. Every package below camps in the right zone for its season - mobile camps near the herds, not lodges two hours away." @(
 @("/tanzania-migration-safari/5-day-migration-safari/","5-Day Migration Safari","5 days | Focused",(GPrice "Tanzania" 5 1.1 0),"Calving or crossing focus."),
